"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학생신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">2024.5.21.(화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">) 09:00 ~ 6.20.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">※ 주말 및 공휴일 포함 신청기간 내</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">24</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">시간 신청가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">마감일 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">: 2024-2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학기 국가근로장학사업 참여 희망 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">3. 신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">:&nbsp;한국장학재단 홈페이지</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;및 모바일 어플을 이용하여 신청(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은 향후 학교 홈페이지 공고 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;- 국가근로장학금은 소속대학이 확정된 학생만 신청 가능&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">신(편)입생은 2차 학생신청기간 이용</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<b>2024년도 동계방학 집중근로 프로그램</b>에 참여하고자 하는 경우, 반드시&nbsp;<b>2학기 학생신청기간(1차 또는 2차)</b>에 국가근로장학금 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">사정 및 일정에 따라 변경 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학년도 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학기 국가근로통합신청 학생매뉴얼&nbsp;각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
